# ---------------- RPG_Duel.events (Task 37 Part F: one combined RPG run) ----------------
# One sheet, both halves of a Diablo-style exchange. Attach it to the caster and to the zombie:
# `when Q is pressed` is delivered to the caster only, while the burn and the death run on the
# actor they happen to.
#
# WHAT IT SHOWS
#   · `my "fireball" is ready` is the shared timer (Task 27 Part E), so a second press inside the
#     1.2 s costs no mana, deals no damage and does not restart the cooldown
#   · `damage Zombie by 60 fire` is a typed hit (Task 9 F2): the zombie's own `FireResist 50`
#     takes half off first, then armour, shield and health see the rest
#   · the burn is a buff, and `when buff "burn" starts` is pushed to the *buffed* actor, so the
#     ticking block belongs here and damages `me`. Every tick is typed too, so a resistance that
#     stops half of the fireball also stops half of the damage over time (10 fire lands 5)
#   · the death runs the loot table (Task 9 F6): `roll "Rare" from "BossLoot"` drops a rolled ring
#     at the zombie, at the item level its own `my Level` says — `enemy type "Zombie"` writes 1
#   · clicking the ring bags it and 1 equips it, so the rolled numbers land on the player, and
#     unequipping would take exactly those numbers back (Task 9 E7 / F1)
#
# The numbers are chosen so the loop is visible in one run: 60 fire against `FireResist 50` is 30,
# the zombie has 45 health, and three burn ticks of 5 finish it.
#
# HEADLESS: `Tests/Program.cs` parses this file, joins both actors to it and plays the run against
# a stand-in for FlaxActions, so the words are checked as a loop rather than one word at a time.

when me appears
  # the duel body: EnemyTypes' Zombie (level 1, 50 health), tuned to die on the third burn tick
  enemy type "Zombie"
  set my Health to 45
  set my FireResist to 50
  set my Mana to 100

# ---- the fireball ----
when Q is pressed
  my "fireball" is ready
  my Mana is higher than 19
  add -20 to my Mana
  put "fireball" on cooldown for 1.2
  damage Zombie by 60 fire
  add buff "burn" to Zombie for 3 seconds

# ---- the burn ----
when buff "burn" starts
  set my BurnTicks to 3

when every 1 seconds
  my BurnTicks is higher than 0
  damage me by 10 fire
  add -1 to my BurnTicks

# ---- the drop ----
when my Health becomes 0
  roll "Rare" from "BossLoot"

# ---- the pickup and the equip ----
when Ring is clicked
  add Ring to my bag

when 1 is pressed
  equip Ring
